{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014q1qoL2RC6nZS9WTnYFnPA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Stack program semantics\n2\t\n3\tA program is a list of instructions over an integer stack, initially\n4\tempty. Result: the top of the stack after the last instruction, or\n5\t\"EMPTY\" if the stack is empty, or \"ERROR\" if the program halted early.\n6\t\n7\t- PUSH n: push the integer n.\n8\t- ADD: pop two values, push their sum. Fewer than two values: the\n9\t  program halts immediately with \"ERROR\".\n10\t- DUP: duplicate the top value. Empty stack: halt with \"ERROR\".\n11\t- SWAP: exchange the top two values. Fewer than two values: halt with\n12\t  \"ERROR\".\n13\t- POP: remove the top value. Empty stack: the stack stays empty and the\n14\t  program continues.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8880cd6-95e5-44b1-bb17-31c645319960","uuid":"9748179c-8ae4-46ba-a2b1-9b40b733e6fb","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:03:40.096Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t20/primary/exec-ws/package/artifacts/spec.md","content":"# Stack program semantics\n\nA program is a list of instructions over an integer stack, initially\nempty. Result: the top of the stack after the last instruction, or\n\"EMPTY\" if the stack is empty, or \"ERROR\" if the program halted early.\n\n- PUSH n: push the integer n.\n- ADD: pop two values, push their sum. Fewer than two values: the\n  program halts immediately with \"ERROR\".\n- DUP: duplicate the top value. Empty stack: halt with \"ERROR\".\n- SWAP: exchange the top two values. Fewer than two values: halt with\n  \"ERROR\".\n- POP: remove the top value. Empty stack: the stack stays empty and the\n  program continues.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
